reagent-name-nutricryokomp = Nutricryocomp
reagent-desc-nutricryokomp = A cryogenic preparation that rapidly replenishes nutrient deficiencies, reduces metabolic stress, and provides energy. Effective on both the living and the dead.

reagent-name-darvinium = Darvinium
reagent-desc-darvinium = A medication capable of accelerating the genomic development of almost any lower-order creature, transforming it into a humanoid.

reagent-name-universal-solvent = Universal Solvent
reagent-desc-universal-solvent = A potent cleaning agent, banned in most jurisdictions due to safety concerns. Exceptionally effective at dissolving skin, scales, and down. Visually identical to standard janitorial cleaning fluid.

reagent-name-h-32 = H-32
reagent-desc-h-32 = A cryogenic preparation developed for use in high-radiation field environments. Effective on both the living and the dead.

reagent-name-antidon = Antidon
reagent-desc-antidon = A specialized cryogenic reagent designed to treat poisoning, effectively neutralizing toxic damage. Effective on both the living and the dead.

reagent-name-brutedon = Brutedon
reagent-desc-brutedon = An advanced cryogenic agent for treating mechanical injuries, capable of healing all types of physical trauma. Effective on both the living and the dead.
